	Reference fasta:         data/ref/T2T-CHM13.v2.fasta
	Telomere motif:          TTAGGG


Extracting sequence information

seqkit fx2tab -j 6 -o assembly/qc/phased_hprc/HG002/T2T_contigs.haplotype2.seqinfo.txt data/ref/hprc/HG002/HG002.haplotype2.fasta


Extracting 1000bps from start and end of sequences for telomere motif identification

seqkit subseq -w 0 -j 6 -r 1:1000/-1000:-1 data/ref/hprc/HG002/HG002.haplotype2.fasta >assembly/qc/phased_hprc/HG002/T2T_contigs.haplotype2.teloinput.fa


searching telomere motif

tidk search -d . -f assembly/qc/phased_hprc/HG002/T2T_contigs.haplotype2.teloinput.fa -o assembly/qc/phased_hprc/HG002/T2T_contigs.haplotype2 -s TTAGGG -w 1000


